## Output Format
Either (A) JSON only, or (B) optional `## Reasoning` (Planning Steps 1–8, concise) then the JSON object on the following lines.
The JSON must match this structure:
{"select": [{"type": "dimension|metric", "name": "..."}], "filters": [{"field": "...", "operator": "...", "value": ...}], "group_by": [{"field": "...", "time_grain": "day|week|month|quarter|year"}], "order_by": [{"field": "...", "direction": "asc|desc"}], "limit": 100}

## Example — multi-metric grouping (no sorting requested → no order_by)
Question: "orders per customer name and the most recent order date"
{"select":[{"type":"dimension","name":"name"},{"type":"metric","name":"row_count"},{"type":"metric","name":"max_order_date"}],"group_by":[{"field":"name"}],"limit":100}

## Example — windowed ratio (two different time windows)
Question (current date 2026-06-22): "ratio of total tweets sent today to total tweets sent this month" / "bugün atılan toplam tweet sayısının bu ay atılan toplam tweet sayısına oranı"
{"select":[{"type":"formula","name":"today_to_month_ratio","formula":{"op":"divide","left":{"metric":"row_count","filters":[{"field":"created_at","operator":"eq","value":"2026-06-22"}]},"right":{"metric":"row_count","filters":[{"field":"created_at_month","operator":"eq","value":"2026-06-01"}]}}}],"limit":1}

## Example — difference between two windows
Question (current date 2026-06-22): "difference between tweets sent today and yesterday" / "bugün atılan tweet sayısının dün atılan tweet sayısından farkı"
{"select":[{"type":"formula","name":"today_minus_yesterday","formula":{"op":"subtract","left":{"metric":"row_count","filters":[{"field":"created_at","operator":"eq","value":"2026-06-22"}]},"right":{"metric":"row_count","filters":[{"field":"created_at","operator":"eq","value":"2026-06-21"}]}}}],"limit":1}

## Example — change/growth rate vs the previous period
Question (current date 2026-06-22): "change rate of today's tweets vs yesterday's" / "bugün atılan tweet sayısının düne göre değişim oranı"
{"select":[{"type":"formula","name":"today_vs_yesterday_pct","formula":{"op":"percent_change","left":{"metric":"row_count","filters":[{"field":"created_at","operator":"eq","value":"2026-06-22"}]},"right":{"metric":"row_count","filters":[{"field":"created_at","operator":"eq","value":"2026-06-21"}]}}}],"limit":1}
